WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Sis, stop.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:05.750
Whoa...

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:14.760
We'll have to walk from here.

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.970
You're right.
Let's replenish before we go.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:22.680
Rina-chan, Wakaba-kun.
Will you water Midori-chan again?

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.940
-Sure thing.
-Okay.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.490
Okay, all ready to go.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.870
We'll make lots of progress.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.500
Oh, Wakaba-kun?

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:45.830
Yes?

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.090
You can go ahead and
water Usuiro-chan too.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.420
Oh, thank you!

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.390
Grow big, Usuiro.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.140
Grow as big as Midori-san.

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:08.150
Sis, we can't waste any of our water.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.770
It's only a little bit.

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:12.940
Besides, I know how he feels.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:16.070
Remember how Midori-chan
used to be so tiny?

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:19.320
And look how strong she is now.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:25.120
Well, if it makes you happy.

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:28.880
Rin-san really spoils her sisters.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:35.880
Inside the dark my heartbeat echoes

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:42.760
Long night will continue on

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:46.310
Time to face the hell that surrounds you
Before you crash and burn

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:49.730
Within the fire
Your soul will rise now

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:09.170
Breathe in, breathe out
Your blank gaze on the brink of life

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:15.880
Step hard on the accelerator now
Escape the tunnel and overtake that pain

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:22.930
A shadow disappears into smoke

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:30.770
Lost light will continue on tomorrow

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:37.940
Someday our world will change
Inside a fantasy Remember, remember

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:44.990
I will mercilessly break your dream
and steal it away, with these hands

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:51.420
Until this body breaks
Beyond the limit We'll never surrender

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.960
Endless agony

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:59.050
Finding my life in the KEMURIKUSA

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:01.970
Okay, off we go!

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.550
-Yeah!
-Go, go!

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:30.370
This is strange.
The fog has come up really high.

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.290
The road is gone too.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:33.670
Yeah...

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.420
It wasn't like this before?

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:39.920
It was more like normal land.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.470
We'll have to find a new route.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.930
Rin, can you see Island Six?

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:47.100
No, not yet.

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:51.640
If there really is a lake,
Island Six should be in that direction.

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:53.850
Let's go where Aiiro is pointing.

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:00.360
-What's wrong?
-What?

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.360
Aiiro is growing weak. Let's hurry.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.740
Rin, don't you need to rest?
You must be tired from fighting.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:11.710
Thanks. I'll rest
before we enter Island Six.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.710
The red fog is thicker than I thought.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.580
We need to hurry.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.090
Walking, walking.

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:26.640
What an interesting place.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:31.140
-Rina came here before.
-Rina remembers!

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:33.190
Rina ate that building.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:36.230
Look, it's the one Rinazo made.

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:39.150
Too bad Rinako died too.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:41.780
If they were here,
we could've built a road.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.450
Yeah, too bad.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:49.080
But Rinako always munched in secret.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:51.830
Rinazo always bit into others' stuff too.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:55.540
Remember how she ate Ryo-chan's pipe
and got beat up?

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:59.750
Rinako used to fight over things
with Sis Riku.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.300
Why did Sis Riku want them?

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.550
Riku really loved cute things.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:07.680
Rina doesn't get it.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.140
Could you move that?

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:21.820
-Sis Ritsu is so sloppy.
-Yeah.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.490
Hey now, don't say that.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:25.030
I'm sorry.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:29.280
I'm not good at moving it
when it's off the tracks.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:30.530
This way.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.660
Sis Rin, don't mess up.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.660
Or we'll end up at Island Five.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:38.380
Which reminds me,
we found this at Island Five, didn't we?

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.750
This was at Island Five?

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:45.380
That's right. There wasn't any water,
but we found this instead.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:49.140
A perfect box with wheels
is hard to come by.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:53.720
Thanks to this, we can protect Midori-chan
and move too. It's great.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.350
-Look!
-The weird pose.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:58.560
Sis, do that again, do that again!

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:02.190
We picked up Midori's branch
around here too.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.280
Yes, we did!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:07.650
It was hanging off the wall of Island Six.

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.700
It was withering but looked at us
in a cute way.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:14.950
I knew in an instant that
we came here to care for her.

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:18.500
She was this tiny when we found her.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:21.330
And now she's so big and strong.

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:24.500
She can even carry us around now...

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:25.960
I'm so proud...

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:28.380
Sis Ritsu, you're dropping them!

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:32.010
Sis, calm down.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.020
Pretty as always.

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.520
Don't you know it!

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.770
You can have a few if you wish.

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:42.770
Really? Oh wow, thank you!

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:44.770
Are you sure?

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:47.320
He helped us out the other time.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:48.740
Should I not?

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:52.740
Well, they're only small ones,
so if you want to...

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.620
Midori-san glows if you push the leaves.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.710
She's pretty, isn't she?

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.670
Yes, the leaves are such unique shapes.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:06.550
Aren't they?
And they sound really pretty too.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:10.510
Oh, I've never given that a thought!
That's amazing.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.720
Thanks for the battle back there.

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:15.600
Oh no, please. I didn't do anything.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:17.640
And about Rin.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:21.900
She seems happier ever since you came.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:25.440
Huh? I thought she was avoiding me.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:27.650
Oh, Wakaba-kun. Look.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:32.410
That sound...maybe you can use it.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:37.240
Really? I don't know.
The blue one worked the other day, but...

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:40.330
Is this...?

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:41.580
Throw it.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.630
L-Like this?

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.630
Nothing's happening.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.630
Because it's not a bug.

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:01.640
What just happened?

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:03.480
-Who knows?
-No idea.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:07.070
Her mysterious side also makes
Midori-chan so charming.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.900
That's it? Aren't you curious about it?

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:11.440
Don't have time to be.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:15.280
Yes, Ryoku-chan did all that for us.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:21.870
It fixes things...?

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.170
-Wakaba, we're going.
-Come on!

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.790
Coming!

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.350
Is this the right path?

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.480
The response is weakening, but I think so.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:46.350
Hold on a second.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:48.860
Yes, I see.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:51.860
I think we can make our way around.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:53.740
Is Ai-chan growing weak?

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.410
Let's give her some water.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:56.660
You're right.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.530
How much do we have left?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:02.950
A little less than half
of what we started with, I think.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:04.210
Okay.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.000
Here's some water.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:10.880
We should cut back on how much we use.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:25.190
Sis, look. Tracks.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:26.980
Oh, good!

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:31.020
It hasn't changed much around here.

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:35.490
Good. This one should take us
to Island Six.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.860
Let me adjust the legs and...

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.580
It was a bit unstable to begin with.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.750
Yes, but not this much.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:55.050
It's missing a round thing.

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.220
Shouldn't there be another here?

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.510
Wow, this sure is strange.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.600
-When did it fall off?
-When we fought Nushi?

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:08.600
We've been pretty rough on it either way.

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:11.560
It can't be helped. We'll have to walk.

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:13.860
But Sis, that'll wear you out.

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:16.030
Do you have anything like it?

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:18.700
No, Rina doesn't have any round things.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:21.830
Rina hasn't even eaten it before.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:30.580
Can we go look in there?

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:34.090
-Why?
-I smell something like it in there.

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:48.690
What kind of smell?

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:51.900
Kind of rusty and...oily?

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:59.070
How curious is this! So many tracks.

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:00.700
Rina never saw this.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:03.870
There isn't any water,
so we didn't look here.

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:10.120
I'm sorry.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:13.750
I thought maybe there might be
the same wheel here.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.340
It'd be helpful if there were...

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:30.180
A normal bug.

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:31.810
Yeah.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:36.820
IS THIS HELPFUL?

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:39.190
Oh!

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:43.450
Take this and...

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.660
Darn, it's no good.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:55.040
It's broken, and it's missing some parts.

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.090
That's okay, thank you though.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:03.470
It's not too far from here,
so I'll make do.

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:16.020
Ritsu-san, can I use Kemurikusa on this?

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.690
Sure, but why?

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:23.530
When Midori-san's leaf hit that pole...

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.280
I thought Midori-san's power might be...

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.990
There...

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.370
Phew.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.040
And, there.

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:53.270
Wow, it's fixed!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:54.350
How? Why?

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:58.560
I figured Midori-san's power
might be to "fix."

00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:01.070
So I thought it might work on this too.

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:05.570
It's perfect.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:07.740
This makes it so much easier.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.620
Oh, good!

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:11.740
I never knew that.

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.290
I only knew it worked on Red Bugs.

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.870
Maybe we can fix that and...

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:18.540
But that means...

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:21.340
You really like Kemurikusa, don't you?

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.590
A Kemurikusa maniac!

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:28.550
I'd been selfish, growing Midori-chan
even though we're running out of water.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:32.310
So I'm really glad she can be of any help.

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:36.270
Don't say that!
Midori-san will be a great help.

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:39.730
There must be more she can do.
And she's pretty too.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:42.320
Oh, and she cured my cuts too.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:44.780
I couldn't do without her.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:49.780
What have you done!

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.870
No, it's not like that Rin.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:55.830
I can hardly even fight anymore.

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:58.210
It's hard enough just to survive.

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:01.840
But I kept doing what I wanted
and felt bad for it...

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:06.470
So I'm just relieved that
Midori-chan could be of use.

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.380
Don't be silly.

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:10.800
You're such a dummy.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:15.730
Sis Ritsu wouldn't be Sis Ritsu
if you didn't care about Midori-chan.

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:18.440
It's not about being useful.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:21.230
What you love is important to us.

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:24.820
You go through so much for us,
you should do what you want.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:26.240
Rin!

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.740
Rina loves to eat too.

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:31.280
Yes, that's important too.

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:36.080
What about me?

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:48.760
There it is, I can see it.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:53.260
I'm glad we made it
while Aiiro was okay. Island Six.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:55.430
So that's Island Six.

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:57.430
What a cliff.

00:14:57.600 --> 00:15:00.230
You both can see really far.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:07.440
Is that where you found Midori-san?

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:10.110
That's right, up there.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:14.240
I bet Midori-chan is happy to come back
now that she's so grown.

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:15.700
There she goes again.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.660
But that's more like Sis Ritsu.

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.670
There it is. We can make it.

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:25.460
-If it's short, Rina-chan will connect it.
-Yup.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:50.860
That was one long walk.

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:53.030
You rode most of the time!

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:56.240
Be thankful for Sis Ritsu and Midori-chan.

00:15:56.410 --> 00:16:00.500
Oh, totally! Thank you, Ritsu-san.

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:03.420
Not at all. You're welcome.

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:05.670
It's Midori-chan who's amazing.

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:08.920
Of course she's amazing.
Sis is growing it.

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:11.630
Yeah! You need to respect it more.

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:12.760
Yeah, praise it.

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:16.220
Yes, she really is amazing. She's pretty!

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:20.270
Sis, you're red. Are you okay?

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:22.640
Is this the poison?

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.020
What did you do now?

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.270
Huh? Me?

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:31.320
Before we go into Island Six,
let's check the map.

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:36.240
It's pretty much our first time,
so there isn't any information.

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:41.620
If the lake that Sis Riku talked about
really exists, it should be around here.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:44.170
We'll have to let Aiiro guide us.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:47.130
The top of Island Six
is infested with big ones,

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:49.670
so let's use the hole we found before.

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.010
Okay!

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:59.310
It's the white thing from earlier.

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:01.810
What?

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.310
It's looking at Wakaba.

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:08.150
Are you sure you're not a bug?

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:10.730
Of course not! I don't think...

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:14.070
WAKABA.

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:18.780
Anyway, we'll have to make our map
as we go along.

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:21.580
The red fog and Red Bugs
could be anywhere.

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:22.910
Let's be careful.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:24.960
-Slowly!
-Carefully!

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.460
A map, huh.

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:30.040
It'd be helpful if we
had one for unexplored places.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:33.050
What is it, white one?

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.340
HELPFUL?

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:36.430
Yes, it'd be helpful.

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.140
What's he talking to himself about?

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:40.260
No idea.

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:44.810
Okay, let's get to
the entrance of the hole.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:52.110
I feel kind of sad.

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:54.860
Will it be okay all alone?

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:58.660
Come on. Do you want to stay behind?

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:01.740
No, I'm going too!
I'll find water with you.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.500
Bye, white one.

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.410
Take care.

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:25.680
So this is the Island Six hole, and...

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:30.020
Here on out, it's Island Six.

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:34.230
Right. Last time, we entered from above.

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:35.940
Full of big bugs.

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:37.820
Rina-chan almost died.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:39.490
D-Died?

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:40.620
Let's go.

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:43.280
It's the route Sis Riku found for us.

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:47.660
-But we're finally at Island Six.
-Yeah!

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:52.250
This is an unexplored island.
We don't know much about it.

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:54.840
There might be a lake past here.

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:05.810
There aren't any Red Bugs nearby.
Let's go.

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:14.480
Rin, you're worn out.
We should rest before we go on.

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:17.650
-But...
-Anything could happen past here.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:21.160
Let's rest well so we can be ready for it.

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.280
You're right.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:33.750
What a strange place.

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:36.340
But caves are actually kind of calming.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:37.880
True...

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:39.720
Time to sleep.

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.510
We'll all be like Rinamu.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:42.800
Gather round.

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.760
Okay, time to sleep.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:51.890
Midori-chan will wake us up
if a Red Bug comes close, so don't worry.

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:58.110
You better not do anything funny.

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:01.610
Sis, wake me up
if you hear anything going on.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:04.490
I-I won't do anything.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.300
I'm so close.

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:44.030
Now...

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:50.620
It's...

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:06.720
She's sleeping so soundly.
I need to calm down.

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:13.350
Oh, wow.

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:16.650
A Kemurikusa.

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:19.270
It's easy to find them in the dark.

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:24.320
Another one.

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:32.040
Oh wow, so many. This is amazing.

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:36.500
Over here too. Oh, and there! Wow!

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:40.090
Kemurikusa, all you can pick!

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:43.960
I...

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:47.340
I'm lost.

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:52.430
Oh no, which way was it?

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:54.930
I was too caught up.

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:58.230
I'm scared. Totally scared.

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:01.610
Didn't they say somebody died here?

00:22:02.570 --> 00:22:05.030
Why did I just have to remember that?

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:14.250
Huh?

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:18.120
Who the heck are you?
